WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.698
In a 10-column number chart, what is one to the right of 221? Let us think carefully.

00:00:06.698 --> 00:00:13.196
Each right or left square changes by one; each row changes by ten. The answer is 222.

00:00:13.196 --> 00:00:13.960
Great work!

